            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomonini maneeni kuma afurtama ta fardi gaari hirkisu iti galu qaba, ammalle fardoole kuma kud'ani lama qaba ka nami yaabatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kud'ani lama ka arda lafa Israeliti mata, ka worri namu jia iti heregani gula Solomonifi nama worra isaa keesati golofatu ch'ufa sagale kennufi, waan sooratani ch'ufa worrumati hojja ch'ufa d'ufani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle worri kunini garbuufi okhayale farda gaari hirkisefi fardoole d'ibile d'ufaani, hojja fed'ani ch'ufa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Waaqi qalbiifi heregafi hubacha guddo muumme inqamne Solomonini kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomonini worra qaroota ilaborutifi worra Misiri ch'ufa qarooma ira qaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni nama ch'ufa ira qalbi qaba Ethani ka gosa Esrahi, Hemani, Kalkoli, Darda, ilmaani Maholi, inni worra kana ch'ufa ira qalbi qaba, gurri isaa lafa d'aatu jirtu ch'ufa gahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mam 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.10.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.25.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "SNG.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Solomoni 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni mammaasa kumsadi baase, faaru kumtokofi shanile baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni mukha haguma hind'eesa Lebanoniti iti keeyate mukeeni didiqo mana ira baatu ch'ufa muumme baase ch'ufa waan isaa dubbate: Ammalle bineensafi simpireefi waan lafa ira loatifi qurt'umile ch'ufa waan isii dubbate. ",
